{"id":"d_main_50_af_06","cat":"main","group":{"id":"ch50","label":"Chapter 50 · Ascension"},"label":"Those Who Will Be Called Heroes","stage":null,"prev":"d_main_50_af_05","next":"d_main_50_af_07","speakers":{"maxwell_p":"Maxwell","laplace_p":"Laplace","drake_p":"Drake"},"icons":{"maxwell_p":"si_c105_00_s","laplace_p":"si_c103_00_s","drake_p":"si_c104_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_1","text":"Here we are.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Hotel","bgArt":"hotel","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_backtonormal","movie":null,"shown":["maxwell_p"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_2","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_2","text":"The hotel...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_3","text":"Yep. Some of the buildings in the Outpost have been temporarily converted into medical facilities.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_4","text":"Of course, all we did was bring in some specialized equipment...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_5","text":"But for now, the hotel, hospital, and Command Center are secret wards.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_6","text":"The Ark is a total mess right now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_7","text":"We moved all the forces who fought against the Queen here to keep them out of the public eye.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_8","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_8","text":"So they don't have to deal with all the contact?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_9","text":"Yep. That would keep them from focusing on recovery.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_10","text":"Deputy Chief Burningum really turned up the heat to get this done quickly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_11","text":"You saw all the soldiers stationed outside, right? If anyone suspicious approaches, they'll be arrested immediately without question.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_12","text":"It's our way of telling people to leave alone the Nikkes that fought so hard.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_13","text":"I mean, not that anyone will just come walking up with Whaley lying outside.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_14","text":"Anyway, everyone here can get their hero treatment after they're all better.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_15","text":"Is someone looking for a hero?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["laplace_p","drake_p"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_16","text":"Not this hero nonsense again! Why is nobody looking for a villain?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_17","text":"... Hey. Why are you two walking around?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_18","text":"Because I have two feet!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_19","text":"And these two feet mean I can keep moving forward!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_20","text":"What're you talking about?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_21","text":"You guys are supposed to be resting. You know what that involves? Resting.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_22","text":"My heart feels at ease when I see Birdie, so I am resting!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_23","text":"Hmph! You have no idea how restful it is to see a fellow member of the Villain Union, because you don't belong to a group!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_24","text":"I belong to Matis...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_25","text":"Birdie! You did great in that rough...!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_26","text":"You didn't do half bad in that...!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_27","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_28","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_29","text":"What's wrong?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_30","text":"Ugh!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_31","text":"Gah!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_32","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_32","text":"*Trickle*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_33","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_33","text":"Red blood leaks from Laplace's and Drake's mouths, dripping on the floor.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_34","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_34","text":"I go over and check on them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_35","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_35","text":"Laplace, Drake? Are you okay?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_36","text":"I'm... fine! Don't worry...! This isn't enough to take out a hero...!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_tepidappleade","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_37","text":"This is us powering up after overcoming a crisis! It's no big deal!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_38","text":"These two connected the energy from Whaley's core directly to their own cores and managed to mess themselves up.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_39","text":"That's why I told you to not use your cores and just rest...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_40","text":"And who uses energy from their cores when they shout...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_41","text":"I was trying...! To share my feelings...! With Birdie...! *Cough, cough!*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_42","text":"Long live...! The Villain Union! *Cough, cough!*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_43","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_43","text":"You've fully expressed your sentiments, so please don't push yourselves.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_44","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_44","text":"I should be the one thanking you guys.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_45","text":"Yeah! We all did great!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_46","text":"We only won because of the efforts by the Villain Union! Ahahaha!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_47","text":"Kegh!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_48","text":"Ugh!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_49","text":"... Go inside.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_50","text":"You want us to go inside and leave our guest? How tactless. Not even a villain would do that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_51","text":"We're having a brave conversation between heroes. Don't get in our way.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_52","text":"Go! Now!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_53","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_54","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"maxwell_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_55","text":"Go! Lie down!! And get some rest!!!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"laplace_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_56","text":"... Okay.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"drake_p","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_57","text":"Just this once. You wait and see...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_58","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_58","text":"The two of them walk away grumbling.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_59","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_59","text":"They glance back at us, but after seeing Maxwell's face, they flinch and walk faster.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_50_af_06_60","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_50_af_06_60","text":"Eventually, they return to their room.","ju